        "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"twilight-title\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 16px; border-radius: 14px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2A69B2 0%, #1f4e88 100%); color: #fff; overflow: hidden;\">\n<div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; background: #fff; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 10px; position: relative; z-index: 1;\"><img style=\"width: 90px; height: auto; display: block;\" src=\"/courses/211708/files/68318065/preview\" alt=\"LAVC ARC Logo\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://ilearn.laccd.edu/api/v1/courses/211708/files/68318065\" data-api-returntype=\"File\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 1;\">\n<h2 id=\"twilight-title\" style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.2;\">✨ Twilight Tutoring: Evening Study Lounge &amp; Tutoring</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: .98rem;\">📅 <strong>Tuesdays &amp; Thursdays</strong> | <strong>6:00–10:00 pm</strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp; 📍 <strong>LARC 226 (2nd Floor, Library)</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 14px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1rem;\">Looking for the perfect place to <strong>study, connect, and succeed</strong> this semester? Join us for <strong>Twilight Tutoring</strong>—your dedicated evening study space with tutoring support.</p>\n<div style=\"position: relative; border-left: 6px solid #2A69B2; padding: 10px 12px; background: #FFF1C0; border-radius: 8px; margin: 12px 0; overflow: hidden;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\"><strong>Why it’s awesome...</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 18px;\">\n<li>Open late: <strong>6–10 pm</strong>—perfect for after work, practice, or class.</li>\n<li>Free <strong>coffee &amp; snacks</strong> ☕ to keep you fueled.</li>\n<li><strong>Dedicated study space</strong> with comfy chairs, couches, tables, and whiteboards.</li>\n<li><strong>Friendly tutors</strong> ready to help with Anatomy, Chemistry, Computer Science, English, ESL, Math, Physics, Statistics 101, and Writing.</li>\n<li>A welcoming spot to <strong>build community</strong> and get that extra edge to pass your classes.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin: 10px 0 6px 0;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; flex: 1 1 220px; background: #9EBBDC; border: 1px solid #2A69B2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: .95rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>When</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Tues &amp; Thurs, 6:00–10:00 pm (starting Tue 10/7)</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; flex: 1 1 220px; background: #9EBBDC; border: 1px solid #2A69B2; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px;\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: .95rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Where</strong></span><br><strong><a class=\"inline_disabled\" style=\"color: #314a60ff;\" href=\"https://studentlaccd-my.sharepoint.com/:b:/g/personal/lavc-arc_laccd_edu/EePm1FtJphVAreY5QHjWankBJdCB4QNaPygFEQ-H3w5eRw?e=4gixzz\" target=\"_blank\">LARC 226 (Second Floor of the Library)</a></strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;\"><strong><a style=\"display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; background: #2A69B2; color: #fff; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px;\" href=\"https://studentlaccd-my.sharepoint.com/personal/lavc-arc_laccd_edu/_layouts/15/stream.aspx?id=%2Fpersonal%2Flavc%2Darc%5Flaccd%5Fedu%2FDocuments%2FLate%20Night%20Tutoring%2FTwilight%20Tutoring%2FPromo%2FTwilight%20Tutoring%20Pics%20and%20Videos%2FSpring%202024%2FTwilight%2D01%2Emp4&amp;referrer=StreamWebApp%2EWeb&amp;referrerScenario=AddressBarCopi